    "mwLp1": "<0>Dranleic Haligdrake</0> is a male <1>Argonian</1> warrior, thief and assassin, said to be the <2>Dragonborn of legend</2>. Having ties to notable criminal factions such as the <3>Thieves Guild</3> and the <4>Dark Brotherhood</4>, he also has connections with people in positions of power in <5>Skyrim</5>, such as the <6>Jarls</6>. Dranleic hails from <7>Cyrodiil</7> in <8>Tamriel</8>. His true age and potential parents are unknown; however, based on physical appearance and attributes, it is believed he was born in the last half-century. Dranleic is a notorious force of evil and mischief in Skyrim. Although it is said that he is the <9>Dragonborn</9>, many citizens disagree because of the various misdeeds he has committed and chaos he has caused during his time in Skyrim."
